From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 00:26:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: phy: samsung,ufs-phy: Add Exynos9820 UFS PHY

The M-PHY of this SoC is driven the same way as the ones already
described here: one register window of physical medium attachment
registers, a single reference clock, and an isolation bit in the power
management unit that has to be lifted before the link is brought up.

Signed-off-by: Artur Szafraniec <ganggg111@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/samsung,ufs-phy.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/samsung,ufs-phy.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/samsung,ufs-phy.yaml
index 2b20c0a5e50..a53ec19e2fd 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/samsung,ufs-phy.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/phy/samsung,ufs-phy.yaml
@@ -17,6 +17,7 @@ properties:
     enum:
       - google,gs101-ufs-phy
       - samsung,exynos7-ufs-phy
+      - samsung,exynos9820-ufs-phy
       - samsung,exynosautov9-ufs-phy
       - samsung,exynosautov920-ufs-phy
       - tesla,fsd-ufs-phy
